# "The number of creatures that were exiled under your opponents' control this turn" is a question of the past (ruling), not of what Vren
# did: on turn 3 Bot1 first exiles Bot2's Llanowar Elves with Swords to Plowshares, and only then casts Vren (Sapphire, Jet and a Black Lotus). At the
# end step the Rat is still made - X is 1 - and it is 2/2 beside Vren.

